<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97871" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκοπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cutting up into small pieces</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.912e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1654.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
				19
			</span></i>; <i>cutting of metal into pieces</i> for coinage, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>extreme conciseness</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντομία, ἡ ἄγαν τῆς φράσεως ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>syncope</i>, i.e. <i>cutting</i> a word <i>short by
				striking out one</i> or <i>more letters</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				169.15
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1011e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ συγκοπὴν καλεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκοπή</span>
			 v, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				39.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stoppage, cutting short</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ
				πνεύματος ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ς. τῶν ἤχων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>sudden loss of strength, syncope</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				9.290
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.837
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philagr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.21.7
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκοπος, συγκόπτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
